      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also sometimes experience loss of movement when using three-point tracking. Issue also has occurred upon switching avatars. I have had intermittent success recovering by deleting local profile data, but can't confirm whether it is the deletion or the fact that it forces me into a no-FBT tutorial that actually allows recovery. This also doesn't work all the time, which leads me to believe that the sequence of events matters. I'll work on getting solid steps to reproduce. Are there any logs or similar that might help? Using an Index and one 2018 Vive tracker.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
